      "summaries": {
        "en": "OpenStock is an open-source alternative to costly stock market platforms, offering real-time price tracking, personalized alerts, and detailed company insights. Built with Next.js and TypeScript, it leverages modern web technologies like Tailwind CSS and shadcn-ui for a responsive UI, while Inngest handles background jobs efficiently. Developers can self-host or extend it for custom financial dashboards, making professional-grade market data accessible to everyone.",
        "zh": "OpenStock 是一个开源股票市场平台，旨在替代昂贵的商业服务。它提供实时价格追踪、个性化提醒和公司深度分析，所有功能免费开放。技术上，项目基于 Next.js 和 TypeScript，使用 Tailwind CSS 和 shadcn-ui 构建响应式界面，并通过 Inngest 高效处理后台任务。其设计强调可扩展性，开发者可以轻松自托管或定制，例如添加自定义指标或集成其他数据源。对于想学习现代全栈开发或构建金融工具的人来说，这是一个极佳的参考项目。",
        "es": "OpenStock is an open-source alternative to costly stock market platforms, offering real-time price tracking, personalized alerts, and detailed company insights. Built with Next.js and TypeScript, it leverages modern web technologies like Tailwind CSS and shadcn-ui for a responsive UI, while Inngest handles background jobs efficiently. Developers can self-host or extend it for custom financial dashboards, making professional-grade market data accessible to everyone.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "OpenStock stands out for coderabbit, inngest, and nextjs in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "OpenStock is an open-source alternative to costly stock market platforms, offering real-time price tracking, personalized alerts, and detailed company insights. Built with Next.js and TypeScript, it leverages modern web technologies like Tailwind CSS and shadcn-ui for a responsive UI, while Inngest handles background jobs efficiently. Developers can self-host or extend it for custom financial dashboards, making professional-grade market data accessible to everyone.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/Open-Dev-Society/OpenStock for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
