      "summaries": {
        "en": "Stop-slop is a skill file that removes common AI tells from prose, making AI-generated text sound more natural and human-like. It works by applying a set of rules to eliminate overused phrases, repetitive structures, and robotic patterns typical of large language models. You can integrate it into your writing pipeline or use it as a post-processing step to polish AI output for blogs, emails, or creative writing.",
        "zh": "Stop-slop 是一个技能文件，专门用于去除 AI 生成文本中的常见痕迹，让文字读起来更自然、更像人类所写。它通过一套规则集，消除大语言模型惯用的过度短语、重复结构和机械模式。你可以将其集成到写作流程中，或作为后处理步骤，润色 AI 输出的博客、邮件或创意写作内容。",
        "es": "Stop-slop is a skill file that removes common AI tells from prose, making AI-generated text sound more natural and human-like. It works by applying a set of rules to eliminate overused phrases, repetitive structures, and robotic patterns typical of large language models. You can integrate it into your writing pipeline or use it as a post-processing step to polish AI output for blogs, emails, or creative writing.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "stop-slop gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Stop-slop is a skill file that removes common AI tells from prose, making AI-generated text sound more natural and human-like. It works by applying a set of rules to eliminate overused phrases, repetitive structures, and robotic patterns typical of large language models. You can integrate it into your writing pipeline or use it as a post-processing step to polish AI output for blogs, emails, or creative writing.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/hardikpandya/stop-slop for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
