      "summaries": {
        "en": "ppf-contact-solver is a physics-based contact solver for simulating interactions among shells, solids, and rods. It uses a novel incremental potential contact (IPC) method with a smoothed barrier function to prevent intersections, ensuring robust, penetration-free results. Technically, it employs a nonlinear complementarity problem formulation solved via a projected Newton method. You can integrate it into cloth, soft body, or rod simulations for realistic collision handling, and extend it to complex scenes like fabric draping or cable entanglement.",
        "zh": "ppf-contact-solver是一个用于物理仿真的接触求解器，专门处理壳、实体和杆之间的相互作用。它采用增量势接触（IPC）方法，通过平滑障碍函数防止穿透，确保结果鲁棒且无交叉。技术上，它将接触问题建模为非线性互补问题，并用投影牛顿法高效求解。你可以将其集成到布料、软体或绳索的仿真中，实现逼真的碰撞响应，例如模拟布料垂落、电缆缠绕等复杂场景。该工具为需要精确接触处理的物理模拟提供了可靠基础。",
        "es": "ppf-contact-solver is a physics-based contact solver for simulating interactions among shells, solids, and rods. It uses a novel incremental potential contact (IPC) method with a smoothed barrier function to prevent intersections, ensuring robust, penetration-free results. Technically, it employs a nonlinear complementarity problem formulation solved via a projected Newton method. You can integrate it into cloth, soft body, or rod simulations for realistic collision handling, and extend it to complex scenes like fabric draping or cable entanglement.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "ppf-contact-solver stands out for cloth, collision, and contact in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "ppf-contact-solver is a physics-based contact solver for simulating interactions among shells, solids, and rods. It uses a novel incremental potential contact (IPC) method with a smoothed barrier function to prevent intersections, ensuring robust, penetration-free results. Technically, it employs a nonlinear complementarity problem formulation solved via a projected Newton method. You can integrate it into cloth, soft body, or rod simulations for realistic collision handling, and extend it to complex scenes like fabric draping or cable entanglement.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/st-tech/ppf-contact-solver for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
