      "summaries": {
        "en": "Docling Models is a collection of open-source transformer models for document understanding, including layout analysis, table recognition, and OCR. It solves the challenge of extracting structured data from complex PDFs and scanned documents. Technically, it leverages vision-language models fine-tuned on diverse document datasets, achieving high accuracy on benchmarks like FUNSD and SROIE. You can use it via the Docling pipeline or integrate individual models with Hugging Face Transformers for custom document processing tasks, such as automated data entry or archival digitization.",
        "zh": "Docling Models 是一组开源的文档理解模型，专注于布局分析、表格识别和 OCR 等任务，解决从复杂 PDF 和扫描件中提取结构化数据的难题。技术上，它采用视觉-语言模型，在多种文档数据集上微调，在 FUNSD、SROIE 等基准上表现优异。你可以通过 Docling 管线直接使用，或利用 Hugging Face Transformers 集成单个模型，实现自动化数据录入、档案数字化等定制化文档处理。",
        "es": "Docling Models is a collection of open-source transformer models for document understanding, including layout analysis, table recognition, and OCR. It solves the challenge of extracting structured data from complex PDFs and scanned documents. Technically, it leverages vision-language models fine-tuned on diverse document datasets, achieving high accuracy on benchmarks like FUNSD and SROIE. You can use it via the Docling pipeline or integrate individual models with Hugging Face Transformers for custom document processing tasks, such as automated data entry or archival digitization.",
        "sections": {
