          "what": "Docling Models is a collection of open-source transformer models for document understanding, including layout analysis, table recognition, and OCR. It solves the challenge of extracting structured data from complex PDFs and scanned documents. Technically, it leverages vision-language models fine-tuned on diverse document datasets, achieving high accuracy on benchmarks like FUNSD and SROIE. You can use it via the Docling pipeline or integrate individual models with Hugging Face Transformers for custom document processing tasks, such as automated data entry or archival digitization.",
